-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:zheng-death-and-son:p001","quote":"咸和元年薨，簡文帝時為琅邪王，制服重。有司以王出繼，宜降所生，國臣不能匡正，奏免國相諸葛頤。王上疏曰：「亡母生臨臣國，沒留國第，臣雖出後，亦無所厭，則私情得敘。昔敬后崩，孝王已出繼，亦還服重。此則明比，臣所憲章也。」明穆皇后不奪其志，乃徙琅邪王為會稽王，追號后曰會稽太妃。及簡文帝即位，未及追尊。臨崩，封皇子道子為琅邪王，領會稽國，奉太妃祀。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:zheng-death-and-son:p001:m0154","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:zheng-death-and-son:p001:m0006"}],"interpretation_note":"及簡文帝即位、臨崩封皇子道子連續敘事，父簡文帝；領會稽國不是同句改封會稽王。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAFA","title":"會稽王","surname":"司馬","ming":"道子","additional_names":[],"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-079","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-079-xielang-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family:p004","quote":"子重，字景重，明秀有才名，為會稽王道子驃騎長史。嘗因侍坐，于時月夜明淨，道子歎以為佳。重率爾曰：「意謂乃不如微雲點綴。」道子因戲重曰：「卿居心不淨，乃復強欲滓穢太清邪！」","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"會稽王道子據此段具名用稱，姓司馬為晉帝室分姓。卷32早期封琅邪王、領會稽國另存，不能把本頁慣稱倒置成早期改封年份。"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:zheng-death-and-son:p001:m0154","start":154,"end":156,"surface":"道子","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAFA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:zheng-death-and-son:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:zheng-death-and-son:p001:m0157","start":157,"end":160,"surface":"琅邪王","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAFA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:zheng-death-and-son:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-famil